### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### OIDC Discovery
GET http://localhost:8080/.well-known/openid-configuration

### JWKS
GET http://localhost:8080/jwks

### Signup
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Verify token (paste accessToken from login response)
GET http://localhost:8080/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Userinfo (paste accessToken from login response)
GET http://localhost:8080/oauth/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Register OAuth client
POST http://localhost:8080/oauth/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "BoxCast",
  "redirectUri": "http://localhost:3000/callback"
}

### OAuth authorize (paste clientId from register response, will redirect with code)
GET http://localhost:8080/oauth/authorize?client_id=CLIENT_ID_HERE&redirect_uri=http://localhost:3000/callback&response_type=code&state=xyz123&email=test@test.com&password=password123

### OAuth token exchange (paste code from authorize redirect)
POST http://localhost:8080/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "code": "CODE_HERE",
  "client_id": "CLIENT_ID_HERE",
  "client_secret": "CLIENT_SECRET_HERE",
  "redirect_uri": "http://localhost:3000/callback"
}

### Refresh token (paste refresh_token from token response)
POST http://localhost:8080/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grant_type": "refresh_token",
  "refresh_token": "REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE",
  "client_id": "CLIENT_ID_HERE",
  "client_secret": "CLIENT_SECRET_HERE"
}
